---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How Waliya, operated by Waliya Enterprizes, collects and uses your data."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24">
		<h1 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			Privacy Policy for Waliya
		</h1>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Last updated: November 20, 2026
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			This website is operated by Waliya Enterprizes under the public brand Waliya.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			1. Information We Collect
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			We collect the information you provide via our contact form (Name, Email, Business Name,
			Message). Additionally, our website automatically detects your <strong>Country (via IP address)</strong>
			{" "}and <strong>Time Zone (via browser settings)</strong> when you visit the contact page to streamline
			your enquiry process.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			2. How We Use Your Information
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			The information you provide is used solely to respond to your inquiries and discuss potential
			business services. We use Web3Forms to process form submissions, which means your data is
			transmitted to our email inbox. Cloudflare may process your IP address to determine your
			country, and Vercel may collect standard server logs for security and performance monitoring.
			We do not sell your personal information.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			3. Hosting and Data Security
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Our website is hosted by Vercel. Vercel may collect standard server logs (like IP addresses)
			for security and performance monitoring. We take reasonable measures to protect your personal
			information. We do not use tracking cookies for advertising purposes.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			4. International Data Transfers &amp; Your Rights
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Waliya operates from India. By using our website, you acknowledge that your data may be
			transferred to and processed in India. If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA),
			UK, or California, you have specific rights under GDPR or CCPA, including the right to access,
			correct, or request the deletion of your personal data. To exercise these rights, please
			contact us at{" "}
			<a
				class="text-primary-green underline hover:text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-green dark:hover:text-dark-text"
				href="mailto:waliya.info@gmail.com"
			>waliya.info@gmail.com</a>.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			5. Contact Us
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			If you have questions about this policy, please contact us at{" "}
			<a
				class="text-primary-green underline hover:text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-green dark:hover:text-dark-text"
				href="mailto:waliya.info@gmail.com"
			>waliya.info@gmail.com</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
